From d468ac4608e8800be62d7d3418fe1fed971a1f07 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Eric Wu <eric3u@outlook.com>
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 23:13:37 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 8/9] SecurityPkg/SecureBootConfigDxe: Add Simplified Chinese
 strings

Translate the Secure Boot configuration, including the pop-ups and state
strings, into Simplified Chinese (zh-Hans). Signature and certificate
type names stay as they are but still get a zh-Hans entry, and hanzi
carry \wide and \narrow markers.

Signed-off-by: Eric Wu <eric3u@outlook.com>
